                                "sense_id": "545840e7-64de-372d-9008-3f348babb59c",
                                "text": "The Bangkok government indicated real concern over the developments in Communist China’s Yunnan province. Thai officials were afraid that Sibsongpanna would be a center where pro-Communist Thai in Southeast Asia would go and where subversive agitation could be directed against outside legitimate governments."
                            },
